<title>UK: Sullom Voe Brent liftings up sharply in week.</title>
<headline>Sullom Voe Brent liftings up sharply in week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Loadings of Brent crude from Britain's Sullom Voe terminal rose sharply to 801,742 tonnes in the week to Oct 1 from 500,995 tonnes the previous week, the Shetland Islands Council Marine Operations Department said.</p>
<p>Three cargoes totalling 248,252 tonnes went to the U.S., compared with one of 131,800 tonnes the previous week.</p>
<p>Below is a list of loadings:</p>
<p>DATE     VESSEL		    DESTINATION	CARGO (TONNES)</p>
