<p>26/9     Westminister	    Hamburg	    69,147</p>
<p>	   Thorsaga		  Gdansk	     69,294</p>
<p>27/9     Sanko Phoenix	   Portland, Maine  89,350</p>
<p>28/9     Nord Jahre Progress   Portland, Maine  89,878</p>
<p>29/9     Sunetta		   Shell Haven	78,347</p>
